{"version":1,"content":"<p>軟銀集團創始人孫正義表示，他對未能在Anthropic進行備受矚目的首次公開募股（IPO）之前投資該公司感到遺憾，並將錯失這一人工智能實驗室投資機會稱為一個錯誤。他解釋稱，放棄投資Anthropic是因為當時軟銀已經開始向其競爭對手OpenAI投入資金。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586940.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:04:00.012351+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:43:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:14.251639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:14.251639+00:00","content_hash":"cdf4df60f80bc8e0f576ca12935385eb19411b187fb22acd66bfbfcfcc9bc13f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}